%% Customer journey state diagram
%% Source of truth: docs/customer-journey.md
%% Render: paste into mermaid.live or any mermaid-supporting markdown renderer.

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ARRIVED

    ARRIVED --> VIEWED_PRICING : visit /pricing
    VIEWED_PRICING --> STARTED_FORM : click Start your calendar

    STARTED_FORM --> FORM_STEP_3 : complete steps 1-3 (save token issued)
    FORM_STEP_3 --> PHOTO_UPLOADED : complete step 5 with photos + consent
    FORM_STEP_3 --> SUBMITTED : skip step 5, complete steps 6-7
    PHOTO_UPLOADED --> SUBMITTED : complete steps 6-7

    state SUBMITTED_FANOUT <<fork>>
    SUBMITTED --> SUBMITTED_FANOUT
    SUBMITTED_FANOUT --> AUTO_ACK_SENT : Resend, instant template
    SUBMITTED_FANOUT --> AI_ANALYSIS_RUNNING : queued job

    AI_ANALYSIS_RUNNING --> PENDING_FOUNDER_REVIEW : Anthropic returns
    AI_ANALYSIS_RUNNING --> PENDING_FOUNDER_REVIEW_MANUAL : 5x retry failed (manual fallback)

    PENDING_FOUNDER_REVIEW --> FOUNDER_APPROVED : founder clicks Approve
    PENDING_FOUNDER_REVIEW --> AI_ANALYSIS_RUNNING : founder clicks Re-analyze with note
    PENDING_FOUNDER_REVIEW --> DISCARDED : founder clicks Discard

    FOUNDER_APPROVED --> BRIEF_EMAIL_SENT : Resend success
    BRIEF_EMAIL_SENT --> PAYMENT_INITIATED : customer clicks Pay link
    PAYMENT_INITIATED --> PAID : Paystack webhook charge.success
    PAYMENT_INITIATED --> REFUNDED : refund issued (rare pre-paid)

    PAID --> HANDED_TO_PHASE_2 : status -> production
    PAID --> REFUNDED : refund issued post-paid

    DISCARDED --> [*]
    REFUNDED --> [*]
    HANDED_TO_PHASE_2 --> [*]

    note right of FORM_STEP_3
      Save-and-resume email fires here.
      Drop-off recovery candidates source from this state.
    end note

    note right of PENDING_FOUNDER_REVIEW
      Founder gets WhatsApp alert at 2h
      unreviewed during business hours.
    end note

    note right of PAID
      Triggers: payment confirmation email,
      WhatsApp confirmation, production start.
    end note
